ْقَيْ", "plain": "اِلْقَيْ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/8ed9e81df4b4f749bfd0.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antuma", "arabic": "اِلْقَيَا", "plain": "اِلْقَيَا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/3df1704ad631770c2e28.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antum", "arabic": "اِلْقَوْا", "plain": "اِلْقَوْا", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/242b92a97cb8fc8e188c.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}, {"tense": "imperative", "pronoun": "antunna", "arabic": "اِلْقَيْنَ", "plain": "اِلْقَيْنَ", "quran": false, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/5e85582b19af6eaa2f85.m4a", "recited": null, "recitedText": null}], "ayat": [{"ref": "8:15", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/1175.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "O ye who believe! When ye meet those who disbelieve in battle, turn not your backs to them.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Ey iman edenler! Toplu olarak kâfirlerle karşılaştığınız zaman, onlara arkalarınızı dönmeyin (kaçmayın).", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اے ایمان والو! جب کافروں کے لام (لشکر) سے تمہارا مقابلہ ہو تو انہیں پیٹھ نہ دو", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Hai orang-orang yang beriman, apabila kamu bertemu dengan orang-orang yang kafir yang sedang menyerangmu, maka janganlah kamu membelakangi mereka (mundur).", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "يَٰٓأَيُّهَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَامَنُوٓا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "إِذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَقِيتُمُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/d809a02110ae09eab929.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "sretnete", "en": "you meet", "tr": "karşılaşırsınız", "fr": "vous rencontrez", "id": "kamu bertemu", "ur": "تم ملو", "bn": "তোমরা সাক্ষাৎ করো", "fa": "دیدار کنید"}}, {"text": "ٱلَّذِينَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَفَرُوا۟", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "زَحْفًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "فَلَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تُوَلُّوهُمُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْأَدْبَارَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "33:44", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/3577.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "Their salutation on the day when they shall meet Him will be: Peace. And He hath prepared for them a goodly recompense.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "O'na kavuşacakları gün müminlere esenlik dileği selâmdır. (Allah) onlar için cömertçe bir mükafat hazırlamıştır.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "ان کے لیے ملتے وقت کی دعا سلام ہے اور ان کے لیے عزت کا ثواب تیار کر رکھا ہے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Salam penghormatan kepada mereka (orang-orang mukmin itu) pada hari mereka menemui-Nya ialah: Salam; dan Dia menyediakan pahala yang mulia bagi mereka.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "تَحِيَّتُهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَوْمَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "يَلْقَوْنَهُۥ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/7a76fc78f3de31520392.m4a", "gloss": {"bs": "Ga sretnu", "en": "they meet Him", "tr": "O'na kavuşurlar", "fr": "ils Le rencontrent", "id": "mereka bertemu dengan-Nya", "ur": "وہ اس سے ملیں گے", "bn": "তারা তাঁর সাথে সাক্ষাৎ করবে", "fa": "او را دیدار می‌کنند"}}, {"text": "سَلَٰمٌ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَعَدَّ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَهُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَجْرًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كَرِيمًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "3:143", "tense": "present", "category": {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/436.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And verily ye used to wish for death before ye met it (in the field). Now ye have seen it with your eyes!", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "Andolsun ki siz ölümle karşılaşmadan önce onu arzuluyordunuz. İşte onu gördünüz, ama bakıp duruyorsunuz.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "اور تم تو موت کی تمنا کیا کرتے تھے اس کے ملنے سے پہلے تو اب وہ تمہیں نظر آئی آنکھوں کے سامنے،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Sesungguhnya kamu mengharapkan mati (syahid) sebelum kamu menghadapinya; (sekarang) sungguh kamu telah melihatnya dan kamu menyaksikannya.", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "وَلَقَدْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "كُنتُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَمَنَّوْنَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ٱلْمَوْتَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "مِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَبْلِ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "أَن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَلْقَوْهُ", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/a0dfc464b9e7ae4c0eee.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "you (all) meet it", "bs": "susrećete je", "tr": "onunla karşılaşırsınız", "fr": "vous la rencontrez", "id": "kalian menemui dia", "ur": "تم سب اس سے ملتے ہو", "bn": "তোমরা তা সাক্ষাৎ কর", "fa": "با آن دیدار کنید"}}, {"text": "فَقَدْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "رَأَيْتُمُوهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "وَأَنتُمْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "تَنظُرُونَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}, {"ref": "18:62", "tense": "past", "category": {"tense": "past", "pronoun": "nahnu", "passive": false, "objects": []}, "audio": "https://cdn.islamic.network/quran/audio/64/ar.alafasy/2202.mp3", "translation": {"en": {"text": "And when they had gone further, he said unto his servant: Bring us our breakfast. Verily we have found fatigue in this our journey.", "by": "M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"}, "tr": {"text": "İki denizin birleştiği yeri geçtikleri zaman, Musa genç arkadaşına: \"Kuşluk yemeğimizi getir. Gerçekten biz bu yolculuğumuzda epey yorulduk\" dedi.", "by": "Elmalılı Hamdi Yazır, via tanzil.net"}, "ur": {"text": "پھر جبب وہاں سے گزر گئے موسیٰ نے خادم سے کہا ہمارا صبح کا کھانا لاؤ بیشک ہمیں اپنے اس سفر میں بڑی مشقت کا سامنا ہوا،", "by": "احمد رضا خان، کنز الایمان · tanzil.net"}, "id": {"text": "Maka tatkala mereka berjalan lebih jauh, berkatalah Musa kepada muridnya: \"Bawalah kemari makanan kita; sesungguhnya kita telah merasa letih karena perjalanan kita ini\".", "by": "Kementerian Agama RI, via tanzil.net"}}, "words": [{"text": "فَلَمَّا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "جَاوَزَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "قَالَ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لِفَتَىٰهُ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "ءَاتِنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "غَدَآءَنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَقَدْ", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "لَقِينَا", "hit": true, "audio": "audio/e69a4d6a53d612ce90a0.m4a", "gloss": {"en": "we met", "bs": "sreli smo", "tr": "karşılaştık", "fr": "nous nous sommes rencontrés", "id": "kami telah bertemu", "ur": "ہم ملے", "bn": "আমরা সাক্ষাৎ করেছি", "fa": "دیدار کردیم"}}, {"text": "مِن", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "سَفَرِنَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "هَٰذَا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}, {"text": "نَصَبًا", "hit": false, "audio": null, "gloss": null}]}], "forms": [{"arabic": "لَقُوا۟", "count": 2, "first": "2:14", "audio": "audio/6079ecd9d4fbee344cc8.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"en": "they met", "bs": "sreli su", "tr": "karşılaştılar", "fr": "ils se sont rencontrés", "id": "mereka bertemu", "ur": "انہوں نے ملاقات کی", "bn": "তারা সাক্ষাৎ করল", "fa": "دیدار کردند"}}, {"arabic": "لَقِيتُمُ", "count": 2, "first": "8:15", "audio": "audio/d809a02110ae09eab929.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "antum", "passive": false, "objects": []}], "gloss": {"bs": "sretnete", "en": "you meet", "tr": "karşılaşırsınız", "fr": "vous rencontrez", "id": "kamu bertemu", "ur": "تم ملو", "bn": "তোমরা সাক্ষাৎ করো", "fa": "دیدار کنید"}}, {"arabic": "يَلْقَوْنَهُۥ", "count": 2, "first": "9:77", "audio": "audio/8c3b936e93d2c5a59bdd.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "present", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": ["huwa"], "mood": "indicative"}], "gloss": {"bs": "Ga sretnu", "en": "they meet Him", "tr": "O'na kavuşurlar", "fr": "ils Le rencontrent", "id": "mereka bertemu dengan-Nya", "ur": "وہ اس سے ملیں گے", "bn": "তারা তাঁর সাথে সাক্ষাৎ করবে", "fa": "او را دیدار می‌کنند"}}, {"arabic": "لَقُوكُمْ", "count": 1, "first": "3:119", "audio": "audio/d6b3d7180d0c9cbb5da4.m4a", "grammar": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "hum", "passive": false, "objects": ["antum"]}], "gloss": {"en": "they met you (all)", "bs": "sreli su vas", "tr": "sizinle karşılaştılar", "fr": "ils vous ont rencontrés", "id": "mereka telah bertemu kalian", "ur": "انہوں نے تم سے ملاقات کی", "bn": "তারা তোমাদের সাক্ষাৎ করল", "fa"